  <p id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p001:m0000" ref="ant_dk4_dds">稷</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p001:m0002" ref="ant_dk4_dds">公喬</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p001:m0005" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAEA">瑰</persName>弟也。幼有孝性，所生母劉無寵，遘疾。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">父<persName id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p002:m0001" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAE">永</persName>及嫡母丘相繼殂，六年廬於墓側。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">州人<persName id="c-nanshi-031-zhangji-mothers:p003:m0002" ref="0zm_srk_5dv">徐道角</persName>等夜襲州城，乃害之。</p>
</text>
